or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> Your image can also disguise structures or create illusory structures (but still doesn't disguise creatures).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mirage","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":50},"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DBEAXFSPMMuETKhh","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"l3kCL6RzgpPWG5WC"},{"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"icons/magic/light/orb-lightbulb-gray.webp","name":"Hypercognition","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You rapidly catalog and collate information relevant to your current situation. You can instantly use up to 6 Recall Knowledge actions as part of Casting this Spell. For these actions, you can't use any special abilities, reactions, or free actions that trigger when you Recall Knowledge.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"hypercognition","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DBEAXFSPMMuETKhh","heightenedLevel":3,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ZYoC630tNGutgbE0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"vdkiWHseWrIkzbnw"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mindlink.webp","name":"Mindlink (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You link your mind to the target's mind and mentally impart to that target an amount of information in an instant that could otherwise be communicated in 10 minutes.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mindlink","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DBEAXFSPMMuETKhh","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.D442XMADp01qJ7Cs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"NRWVPbTHWgWC9Dbo"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"light","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DBEAXFSPMMuETKhh"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"uZnqaAtHF7ydMqA8"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tongues.webp","name":"Truespeech (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"truespeech","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DBEAXFSPMMuETKhh","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"h2gNAlPnS09e8Bfh"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"q1Xbh7JpodSojjY7"},{"type":"action","name":"Flashing Charge","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The archival monitor Strides. If they end that Stride adjacent to at least one other creature, they suddenly display their reflective frill in a blinding flash of light. Each adjacent creature must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:28] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round. The monitor then makes a Strike against one adjacent creature.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","light","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"SlM9DFd373PM3Y8w","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Kaleidoscopic Cage","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The archival monitor creates an immobile, spherical cage of solidified light in a @Template[burst|distance:30]{30-foot radius} centered around themselves. If the cage is created in a creature's square, the creature is repositioned to the nearest unoccupied square outside of the sphere; this is forced movement. The cage has an AC 10, Hardness 12, and 80 Hit Points, and it's immune to critical hits and precision damage. The cage sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius from its center (and dim light for the next 30 feet). Creatures that end of their turn inside of the cage take @Damage[2d6[fire]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:28|basic] save). The cage lasts until the end of the archival monitor's next turn, but they can Sustain the cage for up to 1 minute.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","concentrate","fire","light","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AtTVL2NfIv6CUWlQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Solar Beam","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The archival monitor is in bright light</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The archival monitor angles their reflective frill to focus ambient light into a @Template[type:line|distance:60]. If the line hits a Kaleidoscopic Cage, it bounces off at an angle of the monitor's choice. All creatures that the beam passes through at least once take @Damage[11d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:30|basic] save). Creatures that critically fail become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round. The archival monitor can't use Solar Beam again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Solar Beam]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","fire","light"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"6wDa2w7OLuv90iba","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Wasteland Walker","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The archival monitor ignores difficult terrain and uneven ground caused by rubble.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"XvfFVdWrTX4FFgrP","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":13200000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}